//     SUM, HS-level MXR makes any executable page readable, and vsstatus.MXR does so only for pages
//     readable at G-stage; MPP=3 means M-level access with no translation, whatever MPV. A load
//     fault taken with MPV=1 writes a guest virtual address, so mstatus.GVA=1
//     (https://github.com/riscv/riscv-isa-manual/issues/2695). The test runs in M-mode; satp is
//     Bare, so HS-level translation is the identity.
