//     and reads B with vsstatus.SUM=1; VA_N raises 21 with mtval2 0 or GPA>>2 and mtinst 0 or the
//     transformed lw; VA_X faults with neither MXR, reads with either; VA_G reads with
//     mstatus.MXR=1 and raises 21 with only vsstatus.MXR=1.
//   3. MPV=1, MPP=0: VA_U reads B, VA_S faults (13).
